        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat-‘em-up action on the high seas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a swashbuckling pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship and treasure map! Fight your way through waves of rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stages filled with unique hazards and dynamic environments —such as slippery rooftops, deep underwater, and horse-pulled carriage rides! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 4 unique pirate heroes, each with distinct speeds, attacks, and special moves, including Simon, Coralie, Portia, and the hook-handed Aldemar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 9 stages with varied environments, enemies, and gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable heroes with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests with power-ups and weapons, including pistols and whips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay - enemies quickly recover from knockdown attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion assists and special moves with short cooldown times, allowing for frequent use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swift, satisfying boss battles that don’t overstay their welcome —no damage sponges here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Up to 4-player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Game Mode: This campaign recreates the original 1989 arcade game and retains its single-player, single-plane gameplay, as well as its graphics and music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORIGIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buccaneers: Shipshape is an official remake of the 1989 Buccaneers arcade game, created with full support from the original developer, Duintronic S.A. This revamped version introduces exciting new features, including Z-axis movement, additional heroes and villains, brand-new stages, revamped soundtrack and much more!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat-‘em-up action on the high seas! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a swashbuckling pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship and treasure map! Fight your way through waves of rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/37799600fe90e0cab751b2e7aefd7f64.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stages filled with unique hazards and dynamic environments —such as slippery rooftops, deep underwater, and horse-pulled carriage rides! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/7707c610eea4623c7914ec5070c815cd.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 4 unique pirate heroes, each with distinct speeds, attacks, and special moves, including Simon, Coralie, Portia, and the hook-handed Aldemar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.poster.avif?t=1754396312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.webm?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962760/extras/3d8843e19d35a2af846359658d29c160.mp4?t=1754396312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 9 stages with varied environments, enemies, and gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable heroes with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests with power-ups and weapons, including pistols and whips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay - enemies quickly recover from knockdown attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion assists and special moves with short cooldown times, allowing for frequent use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swift, satisfying boss battles that don’t overstay their welcome —no damage sponges here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Up to 4-player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Game Mode: This campaign recreates the original 1989 arcade game and retains its single-player, single-plane gameplay, as well as its graphics and music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORIGIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buccaneers: Shipshape is an official remake of the 1989 Buccaneers arcade game, created with full support from the original developer, Duintronic S.A. This revamped version introduces exciting new features, including Z-axis movement, additional heroes and villains, brand-new stages, revamped soundtrack and much more!</p>",
        "short_description": "Beat-‘em-up action on the high seas! Play as pirate on a mission to reclaim your stolen ship. Fight rival marauders, steal from uppity civilians, and unleash fierce companion parrots in this fast-paced, belt-scrolling brawler packed with humor and mayhem!",
        "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil",
        "reviews": "“This is an amazing beat ‘em up game. Merso knows what he’s doing to keep the game not boring. He’s mastered the beat ‘em up genre.”<br>Mad Little Pixel<br><br>“The developer knows exactly what makes the genre entertaining: graphical variety, different enemy types with their own tactics, and a fast pace. For me, this is one of the genre highlights of recent years.”<br>DKSN<br><br>“Buccaneers Shipshape is a direct trip back to the golden age of arcades: fast, replayable, humorous, with beautiful visual design, and very polished controls.”<br>Riesgo Aturiax<br>",
